                          </svg>
                          Experience Note
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-amber-900 text-base m-0">Crawling through the tunnels is completely optional based on your fitness and preference. You can perfectly choose to take a leisurely stroll above ground under the shade of the primeval Cu Chi forest.</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </details>

                  <!-- CHẶNG 2 -->
                  <details class="premium-itinerary-item">
                    <summary class="premium-itinerary-summary">
                      <div class="itinerary-toggle-icon"></div>
