                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>05:30 PM — End of the journey:</strong> The vehicle returns you to the original meeting point in District 1. The guide and photographer bid you farewell, sending you the full download link for the high-quality memorial photo album right after the trip!</p>
